data: {"id": "4725fba7ccaf4474-final", "run_id": "4725fba7ccaf4474", "seq": 1273, "ts_ms": 1788406657321, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh 处于 Pending 状态，无法调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `PodScheduled: False, reason: Unschedulable` (fact-bd69400f6692) | 确认 Pod 无法被调度且未匹配节点 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `cpu request: 5m, limit: 50m` (fact-0a79ec23d0ca, fact-1bb4bde84313) | 排除资源配额不足导致无法调度 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `memory request: 8Mi, limit: 32Mi` (fact-9874db464ae9, fact-ddec96d90731) | 排除内存资源不足导致无法调度 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` (fact-3e2eae252529) | 提供调度失败的直接报错原文 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase=1` for `Pending` (fact-9313819a2451) | 独立验证 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n证据 1、2、3 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 且资源请求极低（5m CPU/8Mi Memory），说明调度失败非资源耗尽导致。证据 4 明确指出失败原因为“node affinity/selector 不匹配”，结合集群中无其他资源报错，直接指向节点选择器配置问题。证据 5 从指标层面印证了该状态持续存在。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 设置 nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true → 集群内 0/3 节点具备该标签 → 调度器执行 FailedScheduling 匹配失败 → Pod 维持在 Pending 状态 (Unschedulable)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：**Pod 配置了 `nodeSelector` 约束（涉及 `aiops.lab/unavailable` 标签），而集群中 3 个节点均未匹配该选择器，导致调度器无法找到可用节点。**\n\n*   **证据支撑**：\n    *   `K8s Event` (fact-3e2eae252525, fact-497b3050b7d2) 中的 `FailedScheduling` 事件明确指出 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n    *   `K8s State` (fact-bd69400f6692) 中的 `Unschedulable` 条件与事件相互印证。\n    *   `K8s Config` (fact-0a79ec23d0ca, fact-9874db464ae9) 显示资源请求极小，排除了资源不足的可能性。\n    *   `Metric` (fact-9313819a2451) 确认了 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。\n\n*   **排除项**：资源不足（CPU/Memory 请求量极小）及其他非选择器类调度限制。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 41.4s (Evidence 34.1s, RCA 7.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 79.003, "metrics": {"run_id": "4725fba7ccaf4474", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 79.00391387939453, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 79003.91387939453, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 64005.6939125061, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "fai